==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie]] units are necessary for any newcomers attempting this stage. The main threat is Lord Gravey, and he has a weakness you can exploit; a long animation and backswing. Spawn constant meatshields, preferably [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] included, to keep it in place while your [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]] keep the peons in check. Eventually, Lord Gravey will die but will respawn; simply rinse and repeat until the enemy base goes down.

